sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant Recon as Multi-Agent Recon
    participant A1 as Agent 1<br/>Discovery
    participant A2 as Agent 2<br/>Enumeration
    participant A3 as Agent 3<br/>Assessment
    participant Tools as Tools<br/>(nmap, drills)
    participant Target as Target Network

    Operator->>Recon: Task + scope
    activate Recon

    Note over Recon,A3: divide-and-conquer:<br/>each step is a fresh agent with its own context

    Recon->>A1: find hosts and services
    activate A1
    A1->>Tools: host discovery + port scan
    Tools->>Target: scan
    Target-->>Tools: hosts, services
    Tools-->>A1: result
    A1-->>Recon: hosts and services (structured)
    deactivate A1

    Recon->>A2: enumerate the found services
    activate A2
    A2->>Tools: targeted NSE scripts
    Tools->>Target: enumerate
    Target-->>Tools: versions, findings
    Tools-->>A2: result
    A2-->>Recon: enriched findings (structured)
    deactivate A2

    Recon->>A3: assess discovery + findings
    activate A3
    Note over A3: reasons over both results,<br/>no tools needed
    A3-->>Recon: assessment report (markdown)
    deactivate A3

    Recon-->>Operator: hosts, services, findings + assessment
    deactivate Recon
